[38;2;124;124;124m\frac{(\sum b_i)^2}{4}$. So $4\sum(b_i-\bar{b})^2 = 4\sum b_i^2 - (\sum b_i)^2 =[0m[38;2;124;124;124mS$. Yes.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo $S = 4\sum_{i=1}^4 (b_i - \bar{b})^2$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mNow, we want to choose $b_i \in a_i + \mathbb{Z}$ to minimize $S$. Note that [0m
