[38;2;124;124;124mThe key insight: we want to place 4 points on the circle $\mathbb{R}/\mathbb{Z}$[0m[38;2;124;124;124m(each point is fixed on the circle, determined by $a_i$), and then choose [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mrepresentatives (lift to $\mathbb{R}$) to minimize the variance of the 4 [0m
